1
00:00:00,453 --> 00:00:03,789
Every morning, she sat at the same café table.

2
00:00:03,789 --> 00:00:05,805
Her sketchbook on the table.

3
00:00:05,805 --> 00:00:07,737
Her bag on the other chair.

4
00:00:07,737 --> 00:00:11,369
One day, a man asked, “Is this seat taken?”

5
00:00:11,369 --> 00:00:14,101
She hesitated... then moved her bag.

6
00:00:14,101 --> 00:00:17,476
They sat quietly, until he noticed her drawing.

7
00:00:17,476 --> 00:00:19,193
“You drew this place?”

8
00:00:19,193 --> 00:00:20,251
She nodded.

9
00:00:20,251 --> 00:00:21,766
And they started talking.

10
00:00:22,266 --> 00:00:25,242
The next morning, she left his chair empty.

11
00:00:25,242 --> 00:00:26,528
But he didn't come.

12
00:00:27,528 --> 00:00:30,103
For three days, she watched the door.

13
00:00:30,103 --> 00:00:32,735
On the fourth, she put her bag back.

14
00:00:33,285 --> 00:00:36,503
Then she heard, “I tried drawing our table.”

15
00:00:36,503 --> 00:00:38,262
He was holding a sketchbook.

16
00:00:38,262 --> 00:00:39,792
The table was crooked.

17
00:00:39,792 --> 00:00:41,766
The cups looked like potatoes.

18
00:00:42,066 --> 00:00:45,870
She laughed, moved her bag... and pulled out his chair.
